ASHOOR KE HANGAM MEIN DULHA HAI DULHAN HAI<br>
<br>
Pardes mein shaadi ki jo rasme huwe jaari<br>
Kis shaan se aayi bane Qasim ki sawari<br>
Moo dhanpe huwe apna dulhan karti hai zaari<br>
Mai kiske sahare pa jiyungi kaho wari<br>
<br>
Hangama-e-Mehshar huwa maidaan mein barpa<br>
Paamal huwa ghodo se naushah ka laasha<br>
Sin bara (12) baras ka tha bani hogayi bewa<br>
Ab kisse kare apne muqaddar ka wo shikwa<br>
<br>
Afsos ke shadi mein ajab gham ka asar hai<br>
Is gham se har ek fard-e-bashar chaak jigar hai <br>
Taqdeer mein dulhan ke qayamat ki saher hai <br>
Aaghaz-e-Safar hi yaha Anjaam-e-Safar hai<br>
<br>
Sandal ke a waz maang mein ab khaak bharoongi<br>
Be maqna-o-chadar sare bazaar phiroongi<br>
Ab tumhi kaho kya mai watan jake karoongi<br>
Aye waaye muqaddar mai isi gham mein maroongi<br>
<br>
De kaun dilasa koi gham khwaar nahi hai<br>
Le koi khabar Akber-e-Jarrar nahi hai<br>
Agha koi bewo ka tarafdaar nahi hai<br>
Parde ka muhafiz wo Alamdar nahi hai
